(216, 46, 'assistant', 'For Example Project, you have inventory in the **Example Warehouse**:\n\n*   **Pallets in storage:** 17\n*   **Modules in storage:** 510\n*   **Total MW in storage:** 0.2856 MW\n\nThe warehouse currently has 560W modules available. Would you like to see the full inventory details for the Example Warehouse, or perhaps check for specific wattage breakdowns if available?', '2026-02-16 20:36:00'),
(217, 46, 'user', 'What\'s the value total value of those modules?', '2026-02-16 20:36:34'),
(218, 46, 'assistant', 'I can tell you the quantity and wattage of the modules, but I don\'t have access to their monetary value or cost per module. My tools focus on logistics data like movement, storage, and delivery costs.\n\nWould you like to see a cost analysis related to the freight or accessorial costs for Example Project, or perhaps a breakdown of the module wattages in storage?', '2026-02-16 20:36:34'),
