(221, 48, 'user', 'what do I have in storage?', '2026-02-16 22:12:42'),
(222, 48, 'assistant', 'You have **170 pallets** (5,100 modules, 2.856 MW) currently in storage at the Baldy WH warehouse.\n\nThis inventory is associated with the Baldman project.\n\nWould you like to see a breakdown by project or warehouse, or perhaps details on recent movements?', '2026-02-16 22:12:42'),
