(231, 49, 'user', 'how do i create a shipment?', '2026-02-16 23:16:22'),
(232, 49, 'assistant', 'To create a shipment:\n\n1.  Go to the **Shipments** page.\n2.  Click **Create Shipment**.\n3.  Select the palletized modules you wish to ship.\n4.  Choose the destination, enter carrier details, dates, and costs.\n5.  Click **Create**.\n\nThis will generate a unique BOL number for your shipment. Do you have a specific project in mind for a new shipment?', '2026-02-16 23:16:22'),
(233, 48, 'user', 'Can you give me a cost summary for my projects', '2026-02-16 23:19:03'),
(234, 48, 'assistant', 'Here\'s a cost summary for your projects:\n\n**Baldman Project:**\n*   **Total Freight Cost:** $22,500.00\n*   **Total Customer Cost:** $22,500.00\n*   **Average Freight per Delivery:** $2,250.00\n*   **Total Delivered MW:** 2.856 MW\n\n**Test Project:**\n*   No freight or customer costs recorded yet.\n*   No MW delivered yet.\n\nWould you like a more detailed breakdown of costs for a specific project, or perhaps a report on delivery performance?', '2026-02-16 23:19:03'),
(235, 48, 'user', 'Thanks! Can you tell me some forecasted costs for the next 5 weeks?', '2026-02-16 23:21:54'),
(236, 48, 'assistant', 'I can certainly look into your upcoming deliveries, which will give us an idea of what logistics activities are planned. However, I don\'t have a direct tool to forecast specific costs for those deliveries over the next 5 weeks.\n\nI can tell you about any deliveries scheduled for that period. Would you like to see what\'s coming up?', '2026-02-16 23:21:54'),
(237, 48, 'user', 'yes please', '2026-02-16 23:27:54'),
(238, 48, 'assistant', 'Okay, Connor, let me check for upcoming deliveries in the next 5 weeks.\n\nI don\'t see any deliveries currently scheduled for your projects within the next 5 weeks.\n\nIs there a specific project or timeframe you were expecting deliveries for?', '2026-02-16 23:27:54'),
(247, 51, 'user', 'Hey! Can you give me a cost summary for my projects?', '2026-02-16 23:50:24'),
(248, 51, 'assistant', 'Connor, I\'m sorry, but I\'m currently unable to retrieve a detailed cost summary for your projects due to a permissions issue with the data.\n\nI can help you with other logistics questions, or I can connect you with your account manager who can provide a full financial breakdown. Would you like me to do that?', '2026-02-16 23:50:24'),
(249, 51, 'user', 'Show my inventory summary', '2026-02-16 23:52:33'),
(250, 51, 'assistant', 'Connor, here\'s your inventory summary:\n\nYou have **2.856 MW** (5,100 modules across 170 pallets) currently in storage at the Baldy WH warehouse.\n\nIs there a specific warehouse you\'d like to focus on, or would you like to know more about the projects associated with this inventory?', '2026-02-16 23:52:33'),
(251, 52, 'user', 'Hey! Can you give me a cost summary for my projects?', '2026-02-16 23:54:26'),
(252, 52, 'assistant', 'Hi Connor! I can certainly help with that. Here\'s a cost summary for your projects:\n\n**Baldman Project:**\n*   **Total Logistics Cost:** $24,398.33\n*   **Total Freight Cost:** $22,500.00 (across 10 deliveries)\n*   **Total Warehousing Cost:** $1,898.33\n*   **Modules Paid So Far:** $247,732.50\n    *   Paid on PO Execution: $164,908.50\n    *   Paid on Shipping: $82,824.00\n*   **Total Delivered MW:** 2.856 MW\n\n**Test Project:**\n*   **Total Logistics Cost:** $0.00\n*   **Total Freight Cost:** $0.00\n*   **Total Warehousing Cost:** $0.00\n*   **Modules Paid So Far:** $0.00\n*   **Total Delivered MW:** 0.00 MW\n\nWould you like a more detailed breakdown for a specific project, or perhaps a report on delivery performance?', '2026-02-16 23:54:26'),
(253, 53, 'user', 'Hey! Can you give me a cost summary for my projects?', '2026-02-17 14:14:42'),
(254, 53, 'assistant', 'Certainly, Connor! Here\'s a cost summary for your projects:\n\n**Baldman Project:**\n*   **Total Freight Cost:** $22,500.00\n*   **Total Warehousing Cost:** $1,926.67\n*   **Total Logistics Cost:** $24,426.67\n*   **Delivered MW:** 2.856 MW\n*   **Modules Paid So Far:** $247,732.50\n\n**Test Project:**\n*   This project currently has no recorded logistics costs or delivered modules.\n\nWould you like a more detailed breakdown for a specific project, or perhaps a report on delivery performance?', '2026-02-17 14:14:42'),
(255, 54, 'user', 'Hey Sunny! Can you tell me about this page?', '2026-02-25 17:52:24'),
(256, 54, 'assistant', 'Hi Connor! You\'re currently on the **Container Tracking** page.\n\nThis page is designed to help you monitor the estimated arrival times (ETAs) and track key milestones for your in-transit container shipments.\n\nHere, you can:\n*   Review the timeline for your containers.\n*   Track any changes to their ETAs.\n*   Update tracking details if you have the necessary permissions.\n\nAs an `admin`, you have full capability to manage account data and execute all actions on this page.\n\nWhat specific container or shipment are you interested in tracking today?', '2026-02-25 17:52:24');
